<title>SWEDEN: Mooday's confirms Saga Petroleum Baa2 debt rating.</title>
<headline>Mooday's confirms Saga Petroleum Baa2 debt rating.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1996-12-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. credit ratings agency Mooday's on Wednesday confirmed Norway's Saga Petroleum A.S. senior debt rating at Baa2 after its successful bid for Santa Fe Exploration Ltd.</p>
</text>
